              </type>
              <addData>
                <data name="https://forgeiec.io/v2" handleUnknown="preserve">
                  <ForgeIecVar xmlns="https://forgeiec.io/v2" createdMs="1790016741880" modifiedMs="1790016743034" monitorEnabled="true" uuid="bd7cf89e-1b7c-4623-903b-69b37da58931"/>
                </data>
              </addData>
              <documentation>
                <xhtml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Betriebsart 4 — wiederkehrend (Zeit-Scheduler, Wochentag-gated). Laeuft jeden Zyklus, xEnable entscheidet.</xhtml>
              </documentation>
